rgy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:81.8182%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 18.1818%); display:inline-block;\">90%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.2000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:18.1818%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 81.8182%); display:inline-block;\">20%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>) one floor down around the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32826,31030,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">the lightbringer's basin (32826, 31030, 8)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA duskbringer attacks in melee range. A duskbringer never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Use caution when going down the stairs</b>; large spawns can create nasty combos and make the situation very dangerous very quickly. <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wall%20Rune\">Energy Walls</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb%20Rune\">Energy Bombs</a> can help keep you safe while you clear the area. Mages should keep <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Mana Shield</a> active, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can descend with an <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> equipped to stay safe when jumping down the stairs to assess the room. If needed, enter through <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32840,31034,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">the alternate stairs (32840, 31034, 7)</a>, then fight your way through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhound\">Hellhounds</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Plaguesmith\">Plaguesmiths</a>, and lure carefully until you reach the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lightbringer%27s%20Basin\">basin</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,858 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"90.150700\" style=\"text-align:center;\">90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Shard\"><img alt=\"Midnight Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Midnight_Shard_cb3c6e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Shard\">Midnight Shard</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.098</td>\n<td class=\"loot-uncommon\" data-sort-value=\"9.849300\" style=\"text-align:center;\">9.8%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Undead_Humanoids\">Undead Humanoids</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Abominable%20Servant\">Abominable Servant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Ugly%20Monster\">Ancient Ugly Monster</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animate